{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"file_write_streaming","toolCallId":"01a17b25-948d-772f-b7ae-232414c5814b","path":"/home/user/app/contracts/test/ShiftProof.t.sol","status":"running","chunk":"    // Rate at exact MAX_HOURLY_RATE boundary (1000 USDC/h, 1h → escrow 1000 USDC <= 10000)\n    function test_create_max_rate_boundary() public {\n        // employer already minted + approved in setUp\n        vm.prank(employer);\n        uint256 id = sp.createShift(worker, sp.MAX_HOURLY_RATE(), DUR);\n        assertEq(sp.getShift(id).escrow, 1_000e6);\n    }\n\n    // Rate above MAX_HOURLY_RATE reverts InvalidAmount regardless of duration\n    function test_create_rate_above_max_reverts() public {\n        uint256 overRate = sp.MAX_HOURLY_RATE() + 1;\n        vm.prank(employer);\n        vm.expectRevert(ShiftProof.InvalidAmount.selector);\n        // Use DUR = 3600 (1h); the rate check fires before escrow math\n        sp.createShift(worker, overRate, DUR);\n    }","oldContent":"    // Rate at exact MAX_HOURLY_RATE boundary\n    function test_create_max_rate_boundary() public {\n        // MAX_HOURLY_RATE = 1_000e6 (1000 USDC/h).\n        // DUR = 3600 => escrow = 1_000e6 * 3600 / 3600 = 1_000e6 (<=10_000e6). OK.\n        vm.prank(employer);\n        uint256 id = sp.createShift(worker, sp.MAX_HOURLY_RATE(), DUR);\n        assertEq(sp.getShift(id).escrow, 1_000e6);\n    }\n\n    function test_create_rate_above_max_reverts() public {\n        vm.prank(employer);\n        vm.expectRevert(ShiftProof.InvalidAmount.selector);\n        sp.createShift(worker, sp.MAX_HOURLY_RATE() + 1, DUR);\n    }","totalLines":16,"oldTotalLines":14}}
